%% PawPal+ AI Care Assistant - system architecture
%% Render: paste into https://mermaid.live or view on GitHub (README embeds the same diagram).
flowchart TD
    U([👤 Pet owner]) -->|question or care request| UI[Streamlit app.py<br/>🤖 AI assistant tab<br/>or CLI ai_assistant.py]

    subgraph GUARD_IN [Input guardrails · guardrails.py]
        V[Validate text<br/>empty / too long]
        E{Emergency or<br/>unsafe request?}
        T{Pet-related?}
    end
    UI --> V --> E
    E -->|emergency| EM[⚠️ Contact-a-vet message<br/>LLM is skipped]
    E -->|unsafe dose / toxic food| BL[⛔ Request blocked]
    E -->|ok| T
    T -->|off-topic| RF[Polite refusal]

    subgraph RAG [Retrieval · knowledge.py]
        KB[(knowledge/*.md<br/>24 sections + TASK templates)]
        R[TF-IDF retriever<br/>species boost + synonyms]
        KB --> R
    end

    subgraph AGENT [Agent · agent.py]
        P1[1 PLAN<br/>request → care topics]
        P2[2 RETRIEVE<br/>one search per topic]
        P3[3 PROPOSE<br/>LLM drafts tasks w/ source ids]
        P4[4 VALIDATE<br/>schema · safety · grounding ·<br/>applicability · duplicates]
        P5[5 ACT<br/>place on sandbox copy;<br/>move on conflict]
        P6[6 CHECK<br/>budget · conflicts · coverage<br/>→ confidence score]
        P7{Topic<br/>uncovered?}
        P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5 --> P6 --> P7
        P7 -->|yes, once: feedback + wider k| P2
        QA[Grounded Q&A<br/>answer + citation check<br/>+ confidence]
    end

    T -->|question| QA
    T -->|plan request| P1
    P2 <--> R
    QA <--> R

    subgraph LLMS [LLM backends · llm.py]
        C[ClaudeLLM<br/>claude-opus-5-5<br/>JSON schema output]
        O[OfflineLLM<br/>deterministic, extractive]
        C -.->|API error / refusal| O
    end
    P3 <--> LLMS
    QA <--> LLMS

    SCHED[pawpal_system.Scheduler<br/>conflicts · free slots · budget]
    P5 <--> SCHED
    P6 <--> SCHED

    P7 -->|no| REVIEW[[👤 Human review<br/>tick / untick each suggestion]]
    QA --> OUT[Answer + sources + confidence]
    REVIEW -->|approved only| SAVE[(data.json<br/>real schedule)]

    LOG[(logs/pawpal_ai.log<br/>every step + decision)]
    AGENT -.-> LOG
    GUARD_IN -.-> LOG

    subgraph TESTING [Reliability checks]
        PT[pytest: 92 tests<br/>incl. fake-Claude + UI AppTest]
        EV[evaluation/run_eval.py<br/>28 scored cases → results_*.md]
    end
    PT -.->|verifies| AGENT
    EV -.->|measures| AGENT
